# Deploy & Environment

## Local env

```powershell
copy .env.example .env   # GEMINI_API_KEY=AIza...
npm run env              # writes js/env-config.js
npm start                # prestart runs env sync
```

Never commit `.env` or populated `js/env-config.js` with real keys.

## GitHub Pages

- Live site may use branch **`gh-pages`** (old) vs **`main`** (current) — if UI looks outdated, check **Settings → Pages** source branch
- Deploy script: `npm run deploy` → pushes `HEAD` to `gh-pages`
- After deploy: hard refresh (`Ctrl+Shift+R`)

## Git

- Do not force-push `main` unless user asks
- User pushes to `origin/main` on `ahmedwageehberbesh/Travia`

## Scripts

- `scripts/sync-env.js` — `.env` → `js/env-config.js`
- `scripts/deploy-pages.js` — GitHub Pages branch update
